Date: Fri, 24 Jul 2026 15:19:41 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 305/638] cef: apply core Views API hooks

Apply CEF's upstream views_1749_2102_3330 patch as one observable prerequisite. It exposes the menu, label, ink-drop, font and menu-runner hooks consumed by CEF Views.

AI_PHASE: chromium-cef-bootstrap

AI_STATUS: upstream-core-views-prerequisite-applied

AI_ASSUMPTION: CEF 52dac911 patch stack is authoritative for Chromium 124.0.6367.0 integration

AI_VALIDATION: libcef_static reached 5123/5128 with clustered missing menu, ink_drop_mode, SetFontList and SetDrawStringsFlags APIs

AI_EVIDENCE: test-artifacts/-cef-bootstrap-20260724/13-libcef-static-after-core-cef-patches.log

AI_DECISION_CHAIN:; 52dac911; eeddcaaedd
